      "content": "I'll read the original test and the CUT source to understand what needs to be improved.Now I'll write the improved test with better understandability — removing unused imports, using descriptive variable names, and adding a meaningful assertion message.Now let me compile-check it.The improved test compiled successfully. The refactored test removes seven unused imports, renames variables to `utcClock` and `differentZoneClock` for clarity, and adds a Javadoc comment plus an assertion message explaining why clocks with different zones must not be equal even when they share the same instant holder."
